{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:56b562a3b3f5649620f457db7e950ba77371adf97144c11282cc2792d55d2b4b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a94dacb5fddc9504111e7a0bfed41cd7092285eb25fb1e572c0f63055956ddc",
      "text": "向两人撒娇索要的生日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb02d0e5d7ede0039334011cb80730f92d27c47a6fc5f87028911a70f0e09b54",
      "text": "翔太向冬马和北斗提出请求，\n希望在自己的生日那天能吃到大餐。\n借用事务所的厨房，两人为满怀期待的翔太\n特意准备了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a94dacb5fddc9504111e7a0bfed41cd7092285eb25fb1e572c0f63055956ddc",
      "text": "向两人撒娇索要的生日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78306733253078065cfb1a74d3211ed43783f48d30ead0c453689694dbf9f542",
      "text": "……今天的例会就到此结束。\n大家还有其他要联络的事项吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8de1051222ecf56e18bda98a23c6dee91b80b0efcfc21b488b98a010ab52a8c5",
      "text": "有——！\n不是工作上的事也可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38e4734be0f7451ce66c0230f64102a6fdba30ab79cb45f2fb46a0db67e4cc55",
      "text": "可以，什么事都行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:197e50434b1cdea7bb752bf3d1586c41d71e15477e891d9c1feb6453d7c60087",
      "text": "那我就不客气啦。\n……咳咳。冬马君、北斗君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49c7a6bfe2acd00b3efcd927b8a3189581ed244cd38fe709f966c7185b5963f1",
      "text": "怎、怎么了，突然这么一本正经的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff5d364b42b208e68c59b2a0015941f6b410fb6edd4edbb004aafbef9c8fad40",
      "text": "看来是很重要的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97b8eabe04990784dfb88e5827622885a97ce674fd9b327320c39d7afe1a1db7",
      "text": "当然，超级重要的事。\n那个啊，其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36bf2fcd739667d766d960b7efaae6a8219e713f0fcf6507697ffe29c37f8800",
      "text": "马上就是我的生日啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4e6951f71b40159f8a3d4d79376fc7ac1640e5d85c58846c51a6be83d09536",
      "text": "……嗯，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a67cf35c66f2d1f9a3b99014fd0b39f09d7054b88ac948ea077be6e689cc8ea6",
      "text": "所以说，生日派对的\n大餐就拜托啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f87c2fa1bec4d70a4b343c36a93ee1b41590dcd6cf1a33b85ec5298742420da",
      "text": "你这家伙，真是的还以为是什么事……\n话说，哪有自己主动提的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f4b09fa2954798ff12b0859f1d6fa72a60c731badad938ba442ec75f8a8a6a",
      "text": "凭你们两个的性子，\n肯定已经开始准备了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fbfdadabde16965799e402aa5aed2461081c17bfdc18f2da5567ef29d7a9200",
      "text": "当然。我打算为翔太\n准备美味的料理哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e91e0d7f8f5aa0076de4680d07607b31c81d6beeefe3fad16a339c5196924c5e",
      "text": "那么，我们就顺便来商量一下\n翔太先生的生日派对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:881dbd13f39cf8980cf57aa48265484fec89327d9fdbe1a6e0362b618307d7d0",
      "text": "赞成！\n真不愧是制作人♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554ae7757a9928174327fd86775f0e193261a08ddc3a825c9d4b154b72f15997",
      "text": "那首先问问你想吃什么吧。\n翔太，有什么要求吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77c1e1f0015b9e4d16face2da96c636f2214af8eb5a5e2c54d5731181714cff1",
      "text": "别提太无理的要求啊。\n算了，总之先说说看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98b4244b52b704665795df46f2bb90fa5e501665008d632124f2de150ff452d3",
      "text": "要求啊～\n想吃的东西多得数不清呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccc571dd70662995ec68ec96d65e5a8adf64ab5fa09677ff6eb2c50b35d6ea9c",
      "text": "唔～……交给你们两个人决定啦！\n冬马君和北斗君的话，应该很了解我吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afcd53cc8e7a1d60b9fe805fe490ca3b33546dad12853f81fcde7b0643ac4be9",
      "text": "你这家伙啊……倒也行，\n不管端出什么可都不许抱怨啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d1f5b4bd4cbd2126c66633555526ff4485fb0d4218d89e880adefa01a47370",
      "text": "呵呵。嘴上这么说，心里其实打算全都准备翔太\n喜欢吃的东西吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfc4661c07398f52d54a3dfdf698737f525868523c517513fa2aad8025acd807",
      "text": "对吧～。冬马君就是这种人嘛。\n嘿嘿，那我就满怀期待地等着啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fd93a6c88275d5fcfc2744b0a8f5cb82444ce183d63875dd29a4a0f8f4601b6",
      "text": "广播节目录制中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce18767db1dcf8640f7625f1b10417e9ad96648a936f1b72952f08c928b5b3dd",
      "text": "……说到4月，20日就是我的生日啦。\n大家当然都知道的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49cd9346a721741ffac0278f69d2ba9053f9881c4e08742e46a8401cd5196b7c",
      "text": "哎呀，预祝你生日快乐！\n那天有什么特别的安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc19fb27daca01b4b4efbb7532bdc9dfc83276cf95300a27b5a1c901a36a26e9",
      "text": "冬马君和北斗君\n要为我办生日派对哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b8ec7710e29b82dba6bd814568283711aa234d94c9f78449695f22c4194d6e5",
      "text": "他们两个人肯定在构思各种丰盛的大餐菜单吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a649dc59bf2f0195d2c9ea799cd1bf5ef5b3f4ef62bfe28104410b7856e0c9",
      "text": "真棒啊！下次请你来做客的时候，\n可得好好跟我们聊聊这件事呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:790c6cc8f3c0445d99cab814447963b0a21d3eadab242dad5c56bbea259db8cf",
      "text": "没问题！一定会是一场最棒的派对，\n听众朋友们也敬请期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa0592aae4626c2ab3556a4cfad249823fd6491f6b5080e5c958f6e60541eeb",
      "text": "那么我们先进一段广告。\n翔太君还会继续陪伴大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aab13e567f771bc1a273b8eefabbb2fa0df45a10e2952feb8edb4f56950ff345",
      "text": "接下来要介绍现在引发热议的入口即化布丁♪\n不要换台哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1bdacc665d4d3b928afb19b49281cd523e2cdac8d7965d0cffade10357500df",
      "text": "翔太这家伙，把期待值拔得真高啊。\n这可是全国播出的节目啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eedbac285e415938dcf1039753d2cc6674075b22aac6cb5c6c1c8c4cdcc16e13",
      "text": "嘿嘿，正合我意。\n既然这样，那就超越他的期待给你看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70924e9e984d19b8b3677ef698b4069bbec95fb73ef416fe852c5b0d13771a3b",
      "text": "哇啊～！\n这是什么，好厉害～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a93c846ba432fe962ab2494de8f483e09bc01131f9fa43dd30657885653bb80",
      "text": "怎么样，吃惊了吧。想吃多少吃多少。\n专门给翔太准备的“满汉全席”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff3f39628d9132ff0900b5c4b7a2b2ed65730ac1e46aa7fb5984c5f0e2765771",
      "text": "满汉全席？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61e01f10f11735e1d7bcd9a776658e438b6cf02f10cec5b6081c699bfb9e82a6",
      "text": "意思就是把所有美味的东西都搜罗过来的派对啦。\n嘛，虽说只是仿照的罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f1bb165734958ba4325e6be07aa1cebb1f10bea34c6a2d51a22c95178be8943",
      "text": "冬马亲手做的料理、我订购的单点菜肴，\n还有制作人准备的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ec44c986c80cfd14c7427b67ec050b1be85928ceb9467a5017d041404c1d27",
      "text": "桌上从这头到那头，全都是自助无限畅吃的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b528a389f36939dc66dec7ce5e9fdeed296becb3d5ebb3102a2b9587158d859",
      "text": "不仅是中华料理，日式西式应有尽有，\n总之把你喜欢吃的东西全塞进去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea9429841cc823bdbadb3c4df8e9b40200daaee9457b70384551854dd0ba9148",
      "text": "重新看一遍也觉得分量真惊人呢。\n借用事务所的厨房很早就开始准备了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d5031423b3803925f4cca23cf5acbb458beaea15de61120975b730b7c07ebcd",
      "text": "真不愧是你们。两个人果然最懂我了～\n那么，我可就不客气地开动啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b29fd0b0858f9b1c647c54c950bd46c25b7c25ac7daab9bf3931c83d7ebbdd1b",
      "text": "……唔～我真是太幸福了♪\n谢谢你们，冬马君、北斗君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3199df136cd54c1b495442cd3cc4903993fd677c85a08f8a896412057841b7b",
      "text": "呼，好开心啊～\n就连我都吃得饱饱的了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:423bdbb0024e0d74362535486fdb80f0c489d21924fd8b7768af940935872424",
      "text": "嗯，北斗君发来的。\n啊，这个视频是刚才的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5267ac37abb13f42e47d087f119d68afcb161d6b915fd75b4538aa9e3b6c2432",
      "text": "来，翔太。吹灭蜡烛吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d9f9dfbc76bf8c34f82d462ec5fc46a3f44b8664d5cd51015c0b4e1c458b69",
      "text": "感觉可能插得有点太多了……\n能一口气吹灭吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7550c91633302bd328830a3f4ddcc89e37082a0a0684a2c7c5fd8d71a3f26364",
      "text": "这种程度小菜一碟啦。\n那我要吹了哦，呼——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d6aaa23ee2d0cd7ff3ce5981dd519a66f61e767399e55e5e1f34749269072f6",
      "text": "快看！大获成功☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce8b7da905ef0e2d91a576415e9b348db13b493736ed2362356475553d939e3b",
      "text": "生日快乐，翔太！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f565e31eaec1cfbd4025bc2b0150d6689583182704652683d5d816bd45ae7a3",
      "text": "嘿嘿，明明他们两个看起来要高兴得多嘛。\n我果然超级受宠爱呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e73cca07079fae701df2733ca10859d542d9f2ede86da876d8f1c94c84de1452",
      "text": "这个蛋糕也好好吃啊～\n得跟制作人道个谢才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13ea26481eaf896deadfed46edb04951bc42214ff9f1faa32fae08b7efcd44cb",
      "text": "啊～今年也是最棒的生日了。\n明年会怎么样呢，现在就开始期待了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
